    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, “Kaaba bali abo bakholaana siiukuumo tawe, baukumwa, khulwe khunywela mu sikoombe sie siiukuumo, enywe mwibaasia muli se mulaukuumibwa tawe ku? Tawe, khukhwola munywele mu sikoombe esio.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi echubile ali, “Lukoba lwa Bosira lulaba luriisia, lwe chinjekho, lulanjukhwa, lundi lwe silaamo ne chingoba chalwo chindiiti choosi se chilamenywamo tawe khulwa mindali.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ese Yeremia ndoma ndi, “Edomu, nanyoolile burume khukhwama khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Arumire omurumwa khuboolela babaandu babuusie banamae babwe berekekhe khukhwibwaakala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi alikho acha khukhumala kamaani, ne se aliio olakhuria ewe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwebonia khwowo khwakhutibiisie mbao okhuria ewe nga wibaasia tawe. Omenyile mu mbangaachi che chingulu ne wakhaba ne omenyile angaaki nga efuruusi, ese ndakhwikhisia okwe asi. Ese Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi nalomile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
