    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bukhalaki bwa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi khu Elamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu khurakikha khwe khukhwamiia khwo mwami Sedekia owa Yuda, omwami alomaloma no mung'oosi Yeremia. Amuboolela kamakhuwa khuloondekhana ne Elamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aloma ali, “Lola, ndafunaka buyiingo bwa Elamu, kamaani kabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ndareera khu Elamu embeo khukhwama chimbeka choosi chine mala salanisie babaandu basio buli lubeka. Se siliio sibala nisio omundu owa Elamu khu bakhaonwe barure mu Elamu akhalichamo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khareengie Elamu ebweeni we basiku babwe ne nabo bayiima khubeera, khabareerere butinyu, lirima liase lirafu, khabaloondiekho liie khukhwola nga mbabunia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma wako khareere bubwami bwase mu Elamu mala mbunie omwami wasio ne babemeelesi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, “Mu ndaalo chichiicha khakobosiele Elamu chikhabi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
